{
  "name": "descriptions",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "描述列表 Descriptions",
  "description": "以清晰的键值结构展示对象、记录与档案信息。",
  "import": "import { Descriptions, DescriptionsItem } from \"@/components/ui/descriptions\"",
  "exports": [
    "Descriptions",
    "DescriptionsItem"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "DescriptionsItemProps",
    "DescriptionsProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "npx wui@latest add @wui/descriptions",
    "shadcn": "npx shadcn@latest add http://localhost:3000/r/descriptions.json",
    "npmDependencies": [],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Heading rendered above the description list."
    },
    {
      "name": "extra",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Action rendered opposite the heading."
    },
    {
      "name": "columns",
      "type": "enum",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "defaultValue": "3",
      "description": "Number of item groups per row."
    },
    {
      "name": "bordered",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "defaultValue": "false",
      "description": "Draw a structured border around labels and values."
    },
    {
      "name": "layout",
      "type": "\"horizontal\" | \"vertical\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "horizontal",
        "vertical"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "horizontal",
      "description": "Place labels beside or above their values."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"sm\" | \"default\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "sm",
        "default"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Vertical density."
    },
    {
      "name": "labelWidth",
      "type": "Width<string | number>",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "defaultValue": "7rem",
      "description": "Fixed width of every horizontal label cell."
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Descriptions` 用于只读地呈现项目、订单、账户或设备等单个对象的属性。它使用语义化描述列表，适合“字段—值”阅读；大量同构记录的横向比较应使用 Table。",
  "extended": "`bordered` 适合信息密度较高的管理页面，默认分隔线样式更轻；`layout=\"vertical\"` 适合标签较长或窄容器。`columns` 与 `span` 应配合使用，跨列总数不要超过当前行容量。",
  "events": "描述列表本身不产生事件。通过 `extra` 放置编辑、复制等轻量操作；字段值中的链接或按钮仍保留各自的原生事件。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "descriptions-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/descriptions.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "http://localhost:3000/docs/components/descriptions",
  "sourceUrl": "http://localhost:3000/r/descriptions.json"
}
